2️⃣ PRODUCTION DOCKERFILE (RECOMMENDED)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Multi-Stage Build

    # Build Stage

    FROM maven:3.9-eclipse-temurin-21 AS build

    WORKDIR /application

    COPY . .

    RUN mvn clean package -DskipTests


    # Runtime Stage

    FROM eclipse-temurin:21-jre

    WORKDIR /application

    COPY --from=build \
    /application/target/*.jar app.jar

    EXPOSE 8080

    ENTRYPOINT ["java","-jar","app.jar"]

✅ Benefits

    • Smaller Image
    • Faster Deployment
    • Better Security
    • Less Storage

