───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

7️⃣ STEP 2 : LOGIN TO ECR

Command

    aws ecr get-login-password \
        --region ap-south-1 |
    docker login \
        --username AWS \
        --password-stdin \
        <account>.dkr.ecr.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com

Purpose

    Authenticate Docker with ECR

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

8️⃣ STEP 3 : TAG DOCKER IMAGE

Command

    docker tag springboot-app:latest \
      <account>.dkr.ecr.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/
      springboot-app:latest

Purpose

    Associate Local Image With ECR Repository

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

9️⃣ STEP 4 : PUSH IMAGE TO ECR

