🏆 ECS TASK DEFINITION (MOST ASKED INTERVIEW QUESTION)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    {
      "family": "springboot-task",

      "networkMode": "awsvpc",

      "requiresCompatibilities": [
        "FARGATE"
      ],

      "cpu": "512",

      "memory": "1024",

      "containerDefinitions": [

        {
          "name": "springboot-app",

          "image": "ECR-IMAGE-URI",

          "essential": true,

          "portMappings": [
            {
              "containerPort": 8080
            }
          ],

          "environment": [
            {
              "name": "SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE",
              "value": "prod"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }

Contains

    • Docker Image
    • CPU
    • Memory
    • Network Settings
    • Container Ports
    • Environment Variables

